Release: 1.1.4
 -fixed ProvidedEdiArtifact: rejectedReason had length of 255 now it has 1024

Release: 1.1.3
  -EdiArtifactsLogController: another two new controller methods (GET)
  -EdiArtifactsLogController: another two new controller methods (DELETE)
  -Added the possibility to have additional Users defined in the application properties. Example:
    Broker.user1.name=root
    Broker.user1.password=pass
    ## possible values: read,write
    Broker.user1.authorities=read,write
   -We can have user2, user3, etc
   -Updated the SecurityConfig because of that, now users can have a set of authorities 
    ("read" for most cases, "write" for the DELETE controller of the EdiArtifactsLogController)  

